OL,3,AZelensky says Ukraine supports 'energy
OL,4,Aceasefire' announced by Trump, but
OL,5,ARussia yet to comment
OL,6,
OL,7,FDonald Trump says Ukraine and Russia
OL,8,Fhave agreed to an immediate "energy
OL,9,Fceasefire", without providing further
OL,10,Fdetails
OL,12,FUkraine's Volodymyr Zelensky says he
OL,13,Fsupports the ceasefire, adding "it is
OL,14,Fimportant that Russia support it as
OL,15,Fwell"; Moscow is yet to comment
OL,17,FEarlier, Zelensky condemned Trump's
OL,18,Fdeal to import Russian diesel into the
OL,19,FUS, calling it a "gift" to President
OL,20,FPutin
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
